BT /F2 10.5 Tf 0.18 0.49 0.20 rg 54 774 Td (Q3: How do you handle cold-chain perishable failures during transit?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 759 Td (> **Answer:** The Transporter Fleet Hub streams IoT temperature sensor data) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 746 Td (directly into Firestore. If refrigerated truck temperature breaches safe) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 733 Td (agricultural thresholds \(e.g. rising above 7°C for leafy greens\), the system) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 720 Td (triggers an immediate push notification alert and logs a permanent breach flag on) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 707 Td (the batch ledger, allowing the buyer to inspect or dispute before escrow) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 694 Td (settlement.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 0.18 0.49 0.20 rg 54 667 Td (Q4: How is data synchronized in rural areas with poor cellular coverage?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 652 Td (> **Answer:** We configured Cloud Firestore with offline persistence enabled.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 639 Td (When farmers or drivers enter rural valleys without internet, they can continue) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 626 Td (recording harvests, logging fleet records, and taking POD photos locally. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 613 Td (Flutter client queues mutations in local cache and automatically syncs to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg 54 600 Td (cloud the moment network connectivity resumes.) Tj ET
